      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef power(base, exp):\n    if exp == 0:\n        return 1\n    return base * power(base, exp - 1)\n\n\nprint(power(2, 10))\nprint(power(5, 0))\nprint(power(3, 4))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef power(base, exp):\n    if exp == 0:\n        return 1\n    return base * power(base, exp - 1)\n\n\nprint(power(2, 10))\nprint(power(5, 0))\nprint(power(3, 4))\n```"
